OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by police was in
OL,4,Acrisis, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a man shot dead by police
OL,7,Fafter breaking into his former home in
OL,8,Fsouth-east London armed with a crossbow
OL,9,Fand a sword has told an inquest her son
OL,10,Fwas having a mental health crisis at
OL,11,Fthe time.
OL,13,FIT worker Bryce Hodgson was shot after
OL,14,Fentering the property in Bywater Place,
OL,15,FSurrey Quays, armed with the weapons on
OL,16,F30 January 2024.
OL,18,FJaqueline Hodgson told Southwark
OL,19,FCoroner's Court that her son was shy
OL,20,Fand "non-violent", and that the actions
OL,21,Fwere "entirely at odds" with the person
OL,22,Fhe was throughout the rest of his life.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
